{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 42, :comments ["<b>וחרבי</b> — the letters חרב י\"ו. To teach you that the sword of the Holy One, blessed be He, has 16 faces. As found in Midrash Shocher Tov. נקם ברית — to take vengeance for every single commandment upon which 16 covenants were cut. Therefore 16 times חרב in the pericope of those who go down into the pit (Ezekiel 32:18). 4 times נקם in the pericope, and corresponding to them David said 4 times עד אנה. And 4 times פנה אלי. 52 verses in Ha'azinu, and because they transgressed them, therefore no man passed through Judah for 52 years."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:11:20.747639696Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}